<title>HUNGARY: OTP sells subsidiary to Deutsche Leasing.</title>
<headline>OTP sells subsidiary to Deutsche Leasing.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's OTP Bank sold its 51 percent stake in OTP-Deutsche Leasing Kft to Deutsche Leasing AG on June 30, OTP said in the Budapest Stock Exchange's official gazette on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
